          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ato ngwïn kömöy kor anta sömew nyo gha anta pech anta cheptayta anta ngwïn talamnya anta ptölök anta pokyï pung piköku itï sömewö anta kichïr ompö kwenungwa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "saghat anta somöt anka tïkwïl nyo ngwïno chi kegh anta nyo ngwïno pipö Israel löwïr, kunkït chi tïkwïl nyarïltanyi nko kisusutyenyi akïsyol ewunekwa kïpörï köyï pö saghat, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "itera ompö yïm wöloni imöngöy, ailöstoghchï, aighchï löwïr cho inkïtönyi kïrïp kegh nko wölo lata otöptinekwa (ompöwölo nyi onkït nyo inkït mïkulöwu ptangengmöt). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atökumï chane kïkonyïtinyi akïrïp ortïneku osis löwïr cho tenö cho möngöy kor nyo kitönönyi papotïnecha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
