            "sid": "2CH 6:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kïkany ato ngwïn pïnotyonto kor nyo melö pö piköku Israel, ngwïna wölo low ompöwölo kalïm ororyö nyo pö kaynengu nko ighisyewutköku cho echön nko ewungu nyo awes, ato kingwïn kïsagh kïpörï köyï, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "atera nyinte aighchï kïgh nyo tepinyi atökunkïtunyi pich löwïr cho pö ngwïny, akïkonyïtinyi kïle ato ighöy piköku cho pö Israel, ntökunkïtï lö, köyï katekan kï wölo kïkwoleninyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
