          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Akï ato ighwunyi ngokï, ompöwölo möminye chi nyo meghöynye ngokï, ainarekanyi aipïsyinyi chane pungkökwa, kïnam akïrang kïpa kor nyo low anta nyo lekït, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kïkany ato nonsyö ompö mïkuliskökwa ompö korononi kikïrongchï chane, akïkötö akïlokyinyi ompö wöloni kikïröngchï lö, kikeghacha ngokï kikepotyecha, kikeghacha ghöyityö. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ato kötö chane ompö mïkulögh nko söpontöngwa kïmïkul ompö korononi kikïrang chane, wöloni kikimït kïlïkwï sekey, akïsagh kïpörtoy korengwa nyo kitönönyi kukötinekwa kanasyan nyo kikïlanyi nko kö nyo kyotekunyi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iter nyu sowutkökwa nko somutkökwa ompö yïm wöloni le möngengu, ingarak chane ailöstoghchï piköku cho ighwunyi ngokï.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
